  "design": {
    "target": "Whole-run return inherited from b820404: 17*(terminal_act-1)+terminal_floor+10*win+2*last_boss_damage_fraction_in_terminal_act.",
    "fit": "Fit centered ridge to within-root deployed-score residuals. By original run seed, SHA256(seed)[:4] big-endian mod 5 == 0 is held out for offline selection. Four validation subgroups use digest byte [4] mod 4. No refit on holdout.",
    "grid": {
      "act1": {
        "ridge": [
          32,
          64,
          128
        ],
        "alpha": [
          0.2,
          0.35,
          0.5
        ]
      },
      "act2_plus": {
        "ridge": [
          16,
          32,
          64
        ],
        "alpha": [
          0.25,
          0.5,
          0.75,
          1.0
        ]
      }
    },
    "selection": "Require Act 1 mean held-out gain > 0, each of the four subgroup means >= 0, and raw weight deltas >= -0.50 for take:value, Snakebite, Predator and Bubble Bubble. Among qualifiers maximize gain, then ridge, then prefer smaller alpha. If eligible, pair this Act 1 fit with the best Act 2+3 fit at alpha <= 0.75, and also run the same late fit alone. Otherwise test two late-only fits, best at alpha 0.25 and best at alpha 0.50. Rank late fits by the same tie rule. Report the full grid.",
    "dev_gate": "384/384 matched complete nonabandoned starts for all three bundles. Candidate paired total-floor CI lower endpoint > 0 and no decreases in Act 1 clear, Act 2 boss entry or Act 2 clear counts. For late-only arms require exact per-seed Act 1 boss entry and clear agreement. If both pass select larger mean floor gain, ties prefer the smaller late alpha then the late-only arm.",
    "ci": "Total floors = 17*(terminal_act-1)+terminal_floor. Use 30000 paired seed bootstrap replicates with replacement, identical draws for both contrasts, NumPy default_rng(261123), two-sided Bonferroni percentile interval [0.0125,0.9875] for each contrast.",
    "conditional": "Count runs with Act 1 clear and Act 2 boss entry / runs with Act 1 clear in that arm.",
    "handoff": "A dev pass qualifies the frozen strategy for later integration with v5. Sealed panels are outside this dev experiment."
  },
